  "story": "Print jobs arrive at a shop with one printer that prints one page a minute. Job i arrives at minute arrive[i] and has pages[i] pages; jobs are listed by arrival. Whenever the printer is free, it starts the waiting job with the fewest pages, and on a tie the one listed first; with nothing waiting, it waits for the next job. In what order are the jobs printed? A heap holds numbers only, so put in pages × 1000 + the job's number: the smallest is the job with the fewest pages, ties going to the lower number.",
