  "hints": ["Keep time. WHILE some job is not printed: first INSERT every job that has arrived by now (pages TIMES 1000 PLUS its number).", "IF nothing is waiting (IS EMPTY), jump time to the next job's arrival. ELSE TAKE TOP: the job's number is that REMAINDER 1000.", "APPEND the job to the order and move time on by its pages."],
